# awesome-pages config for docs/misc/.
#
# This directory holds the UTLP (Universal Time Lord Protocol) corpus
# plus a handful of cross-cutting research notes. The default
# alphabetical sort buries UTLP_Executive_Summary.md after a long tail
# of supplements and ancillary files; this `.pages` file fixes the
# reading order so a docs reader can start from the executive summary
# and walk down through the spec, supplements, and prior art.

title: UTLP & cross-cutting research

nav:
  # ── UTLP core ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  - UTLP_Executive_Summary.md
  - UTLP_Specification.md

  # Technical supplements (S1: Genesis election, S2: phase alignment,
  # S3: trust ledger, S4: immunity).
  - UTLP_Technical_Supplement_S1.md
  - UTLP_Technical_Supplement_S2.md
  - UTLP_Technical_Supplement_S3.md
  - UTLP_Technical_Supplement_S4.md

  # Position-from-timing addendum.
  - UTLP_Addendum_Reference_Frame_Independent_Positioning.md
  - RFIP_Technical_Specification.md

  # ── Companion specs ──────────────────────────────────────────────
  - SMSP_Technical_Specification.md
  - Connectionless_Distributed_Timing_Prior_Art.md
  - Distributed_Sensing_Lab_Manual.md
  - Python_Reference_Implementation.md

  # ── Cross-cutting research notes ─────────────────────────────────
  - hdc_as_instruments.md
  - Spectral_Convergence_Conjecture.md
  - Integrative_Capacity_AI_Synthesis_Alignment.md
  - proprioceptive_spatial_construction.md
  - simulation_lucid_phenotype.md
  - simulation_lucid_phenotype_companion_piece.md
  - claims_appendix.md

  # ── Omnibus ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  # 14k+ lines; kept last because it's a one-stop reference, not a
  # starting point.
  - UTLP_RFIP_Complete_Documentation_Suite.md
